column2:
LIMS Specialist  
TerraLab IT, LTD, Khmelnytskyi, Ukraine  
June 2014 – December 2021  

**Project Implementation:**  
- Gathered and analyzed user requirements;  
- Designed LIMS implementation plans;  
- Configured and maintained database management systems;  
- Input reference laboratory data;  
- Configured LIMS settings;  
- Connected and set up laboratory equipment;  
- Designed reports using FastReport software;  
- Trained end users and developed user guides and manuals;  
- Provided laboratory support.  

**Project Support and Maintenance:**  
- Maintained laboratory information management systems;  
- Configured and administered software systems;  
- Maintained software and databases;  
- Diagnosed initial user technical issues;  
- Resolved user questions and issues;  
- Assisted the development team with software process improvement;  
- Designed printing forms and reports;  
- Provided onsite client consulting.  

**Project Integration and Maintenance:**  
- Developed integration solutions;  
- Implemented new and existing integration solutions;  
- Configured, customized, and developed new solutions;  
- Participated in technical integration planning and presales discussions;  
- Gathered requirements for new solutions;  
- Troubleshot code and configuration issues in all managed environments;  
- Communicated effectively across multiple channels with team and stakeholders.
